  "proposed_label": {
    "category": "correctness",
    "status": "agent_proposal_only",
    "rationale": "The newly added memo.add(exc_value) hashes the exception instance. A legitimate exception class with __hash__ = None raises TypeError while the debugger is formatting the original exception. The fix tracks id(exc_value), preserving cycle detection without requiring hashable exceptions."
  },
